aivas (0.1.0-1~noble1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Initial release for Ubuntu 24.04 (Noble).
  * Textual terminal UI with Groq/Mistral/Ollama AI inference.
  * FastAPI + React web UI bundled as static assets (aivas serve --open).
  * Local offline CVE database synced from NIST NVD JSON feeds.
  * Bilingual English/Swahili LLM-powered vulnerability narration.
  * Nmap integration: TCP/UDP scanning, OS fingerprinting, TLS checks.
  * aivas serve command launches web UI; aivas launches TUI.

